From 2ea8f95c0c88567c9ce16b6535b80895e8e0935f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:33:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(post): add clean-room Mach4 milling postprocessor

Clean-room Mach4 Mill postprocessor (`assets/posts/mach4.cps`) supporting 3-axis G94 and 3+2 indexed AC trunnion programs, registered in `BUILTINS` and covered by unit, trunnion kinematics, script, and conformance suites.

Fixes #1968
